    fix(test): DF-2026-11 tolerate in-flight .tmp.jsonl in namespace leak-walk
    
    Skip transient *.tmp.jsonl search-index files during the namespace leak walk,
    so an atomic rename window cannot turn the assertion into an ENOENT while real
    JSONL leaks remain observable.
    
    Evidence:
    - RED proof: deterministic pre-fix rename-window reproduction returned ENOENT
      for .search/rows.tmp.jsonl.
    - GREEN proof: 20 consecutive runs of the target file passed; each reported
      1 test file and 6 tests passed.
    - Negative control: a planted leaked JSONL row was detected, so the leak
      assertion still fails for a real leak.
    - Full suite: 242 test files and 2027 tests passed.
    - TypeScript check and Prettier check passed.
    
    See /tmp/df2026-11-runs.txt for the complete run log.
    
